From 01d46a44e2310fee154e5513a00b64133212304f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Port Bot <port@local>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 11:57:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] 0019: oidc login debug logs (backend + frontend), gated by a
 flag

Ports patches.pending/0010-oidc-debug-logs.patch onto the current stack
(dropping the token-exchange debug lines, since patches.pending/0009 is
being dropped as an obsolete PoC). Unlike the original, tracing is
opt-in via --user-auth-oidc-debug-logs instead of klog's global -v
verbosity (which would also enable unrelated subsystems' debug logs
cluster-wide) or an always-on frontend console.debug. The flag also
flows to the frontend via SERVER_FLAGS.oidcDebugLogs so browser-console
tracing only appears when explicitly enabled.
